                <pb facs="0679" n="555" sameAs="frus:frus1923v02/pg555"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.1211/313a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Chargé in
                        Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Summerlin</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-09-04T13:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 4,
                                1923—1 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>134. Mr. Téllez presented his letter of credence as Chargé d’Affaires <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ad interim</hi> at noon September 3 and it was accepted
                    by the Department.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
